      "side": 1,
      "message": "The reason I introduced `thisPriorPatchSet` is that `priorPatchSet` is reassigned at the end of each iteration (L392):\n\n```\npriorPatchSet \u003d followUpPatchSet;\n```\n\nSo `thisPriorPatchSet \u003d priorPatchSet` is a per-iteration snapshot to ensure the supplier computes `ChangeKind` for the correct `(prior, followUp)` pair: moving L353 here would mean using \"priorPatchSet \u003d sourcePatchSet\" **always**, which would be incorrect.",
